  - ID: tutorial.Welcome
    Text: "Listen up, rookie! The ale brews itself, but the fumes... they make my crew dizzy. Here they are..."
  - ID: tutorial.Characters
    Text: "Your trio: the Bartender brews, the Waiter serves, and the Guard throws people out. The fumes make them dizzy \u2014 they need your cursor to guide them."
  - ID: tutorial.ShowUITimer
    Text: "Your shift has started. Serve every guest before the fumes get too thick!"
  - ID: tutorial.CreateBarrel
    Text: "Only the BARTENDER can order barrels. Go order some!"
  - ID: tutorial.TakeBarrel
    Text: "Grab the barrels!"
  - ID: tutorial.MoveBarrel
    Text: "Hurry, carry them over!"
  - ID: tutorial.ShowUIVisitorAmount
    Text: "See that counter? Those are the guests you need to serve before time runs out."
  - ID: tutorial.BuildTable
    Text: "Guests won't sit on the floor. Add tables to the tavern."
  - ID: tutorial.WaitVisitor
    Text: "Guests won't wait long. QUICK! Bring the order before they fall asleep!"
  - ID: tutorial.SelectedWaiter
    Text: "Guests won't wait long. QUICK, BRING THEM A DRINK!"
  - ID: tutorial.CreateBeer
    Text: "HURRY UP AND POUR A DRINK!"
  - ID: tutorial.TakeBeer
    Text: "GRAB THE MUG!"
  - ID: tutorial.ServesesVisitor
    Text: "RUN! RUN! As fast as you can!"
  - ID: tutorial.GiveBeer
    Text: "You can't carry a drink and money at the same time. Put the drink on the table."
  - ID: tutorial.TakeMoney
    Text: "Collect the coins."
  - ID: tutorial.GiveMoney
    Text: "Take the COINS to the CHEST."
  - ID: tutorial.ShowUIMoneyAmout
    Text: "YES! We're getting rich!"
  - ID: tutorial.SleepVisitors
    Text: "Well, now he's fallen asleep."
  - ID: tutorial.SelectedSecuryte
    Text: "Select the Guard."
  - ID: tutorial.TakeVisitor
    Text: "Pick up the sleeping guest and make room for the next one!"
  - ID: tutorial.GiveVisitor
    Text: "Throw him OUT!"
  - ID: tutorial.LastStep
    Text: "That's it! Finish your shift."
